  "title": "Mayor Mok Shaiz’s Majordomo",
  "description": "Instead of showing up himself, Mok Shaiz, the mayor of Mos Espa, sends his majordomo to greet Boba Fett, an incredible sign of disrespect. Fett, expecting to receive tribute from and make the acquaintance of — the mayor, got neither of those things. In fact, all he received was a confusing confrontation, as the majordomo offered no tribute, only a request of his own. An incensed Fett gives him only the pleasure of leaving with his life."
